list.item:

    Strauss, Robert S.,
Special Representative for Trade Negotiations from 1977 until 1979;
Personal Representative of the President from April 1979

person.note:
Deputy and Acting Assistant Secretary of the Army for Civil Works until 1978;
                    thereafter Executive Assistant and Staff Director to the Administrator of the
                    Environmental Protection Agency

Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for Inter-American Affairs until 1977;
                    Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for European Affairs from 1977 until 1978;
                    Ambassador to Venezuela from October 9, 1978

Deputy for Panama Canal Treaty Affairs, Office of the Secretary, until 1978;
                    thereafter Special Representative of the Secretary for Panama Treaty Affairs,
                    Department of State
